WEBVTT

00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:14.400
Saint Seiya

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:41.760
The Cosmo has disappeared.

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:46.280
Even though my master Shion was his opponent,

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:49.160
I didn't think he'd lose so easily.

00:01:54.720 --> 00:01:59.460
The Herd of Black Cloaks

00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:08.430
What's this?

00:02:09.130 --> 00:02:14.170
The aftermath of Shaka's Treasures of Heaven.

00:02:15.190 --> 00:02:17.630
It destroyed the Cancer house.

00:02:18.980 --> 00:02:21.440
But where is Saga?

00:02:22.210 --> 00:02:26.640
I don't believe they
disintegrated without a trace.

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:34.580
What's this?

00:02:39.140 --> 00:02:43.590
Psychokinesis? Who could have such powers?

00:02:48.990 --> 00:02:53.800
The ones who used to follow
Saga like a shadow.

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:57.340
The ones who veiled their
presence like ghosts.

00:02:58.890 --> 00:03:01.760
They have finally revealed themselves.

00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:07.990
Hades's 108 Evil Star army.

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:10.620
The true Specters.

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:19.660
These many Specters have followed
Saga into the Sanctuary.

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:23.760
Where has Saga gone?

00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:28.030
The moment the powerful Cosmo

00:03:28.030 --> 00:03:30.370
from the Virgo house arrived
at the Cancer house,

00:03:30.370 --> 00:03:32.840
Saga and the other two disappeared.

00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:36.640
And Shion in the Aries temple.

00:03:37.030 --> 00:03:39.650
Where have they gone?

00:03:41.050 --> 00:03:46.650
I can't believe you lost them when
there's so many of you. Pitiful.

00:03:46.940 --> 00:03:48.260
What did you say?

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:50.730
You hover between life and death

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:52.840
and you still shoot off your big mouth.

00:03:52.840 --> 00:03:55.860
Fine. I'll ask your body directly.

00:03:56.410 --> 00:04:00.710
I, Cyclops Gigant, will.

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:10.040
Who is it?

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:16.020
I won't let you do as you please!

00:04:16.310 --> 00:04:17.250
Seiya.

00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:21.110
I'm going to take you all
down, so prepare yourselves.

00:04:21.450 --> 00:04:23.570
I thought I...

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:27.060
Mu, don't teleport me again.

00:04:27.310 --> 00:04:28.390
Seiya.

00:04:29.670 --> 00:04:32.600
I'll return no matter how
many times you send me away.

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:35.490
Not just me, Shiryu too.

00:04:35.930 --> 00:04:37.570
The Bronze Saints?

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:40.610
So, Mu, let us fight.

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:43.670
This is everyone's fight.

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:46.460
Seiya, you really are...

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:48.960
What's all this chatter?

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:56.700
Pegasus Meteor Punch!

00:05:12.010 --> 00:05:14.110
The Saints are laughable.

00:05:17.570 --> 00:05:22.460
The Specters are Lord
Hades's ultimate warriors.

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:24.780
We're on a different level than you.

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:26.330
Don't make me laugh.

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:27.170
What?

00:05:28.950 --> 00:05:34.640
What's so ultimate about goons who
have to sneak around in packs?

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:42.390
Shut your mouth.

00:05:42.720 --> 00:05:47.170
I'll teach you the strength
and terror of the Specters.

00:05:50.430 --> 00:05:52.360
Seiya, run.

00:05:54.900 --> 00:05:57.210
But I can't teach you everything at once.

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:02.130
I'll go to work on your body slowly!

00:06:02.300 --> 00:06:03.410
Wait.

00:06:13.380 --> 00:06:14.250
This is.

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:19.890
What happened?

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:25.020
Traces of the Cosmos abound.

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:29.750
Enormous Cosmos clashed here.

00:06:30.730 --> 00:06:34.350
I don't know. What's going on?

00:06:35.090 --> 00:06:36.820
What's about to begin?

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:46.240
Hyoga.

00:06:47.230 --> 00:06:48.610
Let's go, Shun.

00:06:49.050 --> 00:06:51.940
We know one thing.

00:06:52.110 --> 00:06:55.510
Athena is in danger.

00:06:56.090 --> 00:06:56.780
Mmm.

00:07:02.870 --> 00:07:04.900
Step back, Gigant.

00:07:05.850 --> 00:07:06.880
Papillon.

00:07:10.170 --> 00:07:13.480
What is this tremendous Cosmo?

00:07:13.670 --> 00:07:20.020
This is it. The force that restrained
me with its psychokinesis.

00:07:20.780 --> 00:07:26.140
Gigant, leave them to me.

00:07:26.140 --> 00:07:30.580
You guys move on to the Leo house.

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:35.340
But, Papillon, they're my prey.

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:39.350
Can't you obey my orders?

00:07:42.650 --> 00:07:45.350
All right, then, I'll leave them up to you.

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:47.980
I pity them.

00:07:48.220 --> 00:07:52.490
For them to be in your target, Papillon.

00:07:52.680 --> 00:07:53.810
Wait!

00:07:54.060 --> 00:07:58.580
To be preyed on by the
butterfly of the Underworld.

00:07:59.850 --> 00:08:03.640
They disappeared. Did they
really go to the Leo house?

00:08:09.010 --> 00:08:10.200
What's wrong, Mu?

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:15.940
My body that had been paralyzed
in a trance has been released.

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:16.880
That's right.

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:22.700
I just freed your body.

00:08:35.270 --> 00:08:36.070
Old Master.

00:08:44.510 --> 00:08:45.350
Who is it?

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:50.370
You're so cold, Shiryu.

00:08:50.480 --> 00:08:53.920
Shun, Hyoga! You've come
from the Aries house?

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:57.050
What's wrong, Shiryu? This isn't like you.

00:08:57.380 --> 00:09:00.260
What happened in the Aries
house? Where's Old Master?

00:09:00.780 --> 00:09:06.050
The Aries house was half ruined.

00:09:06.130 --> 00:09:08.790
What? Then what about Old Master?

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:11.190
Shiryu, you must have felt it too.

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:15.030
There's no sign of a Cosmo.

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:22.070
Old Master said to be prepared for death,
but I didn't think it'd really happen.

00:09:22.490 --> 00:09:23.460
Old Master!

00:09:23.930 --> 00:09:24.790
Shiryu.

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:26.020
Where?

00:09:32.580 --> 00:09:33.620
Old Master.

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:38.080
To live and die as a Saint.

00:09:38.460 --> 00:09:41.380
I have been under your tutelage
for a long time, Old Master.

00:09:42.520 --> 00:09:45.980
You are a stubborn man.

00:10:00.770 --> 00:10:01.750
Shiryu.

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:04.550
Sorry to make you wait.

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:06.290
Shiryu.

00:10:09.320 --> 00:10:10.060
Let's go.

00:10:10.660 --> 00:10:11.890
To Athena.

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:14.240
Mmm.

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:16.270
Mmm.

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:18.420
Old Master.

00:10:19.870 --> 00:10:21.370
Please be safe.

00:10:30.870 --> 00:10:32.640
How grotesque.

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:35.390
What is this hideous being?

00:10:37.200 --> 00:10:40.730
I am Papillon Myu.

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:43.560
What? You're also a Specter?

00:10:46.390 --> 00:10:52.350
The notorious Mu. I have
remained to fight you.

00:10:53.270 --> 00:10:59.440
I freed you from the psychokinesis so
that we can fight on equal footing.

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:03.350
Whatever! I can deal with a monster like you.

00:11:03.350 --> 00:11:05.010
Seiya, stand back.

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:05.800
What?

00:11:06.370 --> 00:11:08.770
I will defeat this thing.

00:11:09.790 --> 00:11:10.630
Mu.

00:11:11.260 --> 00:11:12.190
Now,

00:11:12.450 --> 00:11:13.170
come!

00:11:15.390 --> 00:11:18.750
Here I come. Ugly Eruption!

00:11:23.020 --> 00:11:24.770
Crystal Wall!

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:29.670
Ugly Eruption doesn't work.

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:32.760
Take this!

00:11:32.760 --> 00:11:35.810
Stardust Revolution!

00:11:56.360 --> 00:11:58.050
What's this?

00:11:58.790 --> 00:11:59.690
This thing.

00:12:00.390 --> 00:12:02.480
He's a huge worm.

00:12:03.830 --> 00:12:06.980
What kind of Specter is Papillon?

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:10.890
This thing.

00:12:11.130 --> 00:12:13.270
Silky Thread!

00:12:20.890 --> 00:12:26.000
You won't be able to move or breath.

00:12:26.290 --> 00:12:28.260
Then you will die.

00:12:30.510 --> 00:12:32.190
At this rate.

00:12:43.660 --> 00:12:44.970
The Cancer house.

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:48.520
We should catch up to Seiya soon.

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:51.000
Let's go.

00:12:55.740 --> 00:12:57.740
Even after the battle.

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:00.200
We can't let our guard down.

00:13:00.760 --> 00:13:05.250
However, I don't feel Mu,
Seiya or Saga's presence.

00:13:05.870 --> 00:13:08.040
They might have advanced to the Leo house.

00:13:08.460 --> 00:13:10.180
Anyway, we should keep moving.

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:11.260
You're right.

00:13:11.260 --> 00:13:11.920
Mmm.

00:13:18.210 --> 00:13:21.110
I thought I felt a Cosmo.

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:22.840
Shiryu?

00:13:24.330 --> 00:13:25.440
Maybe it was my imagination.

00:13:40.370 --> 00:13:41.620
Where's Seiya?

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:44.760
He's unconscious.

00:13:44.980 --> 00:13:47.050
Seiya, wake up.

00:13:53.430 --> 00:13:54.240
Seiya.

00:13:55.870 --> 00:14:00.140
Mu, if you didn't call
me, I would've been dead.

00:14:00.410 --> 00:14:03.940
Papillon, what a monstrosity.

00:14:04.170 --> 00:14:06.550
That's right! Where is he?

00:14:07.080 --> 00:14:10.630
Even that gigantic Cosmo has vanished.

00:14:10.630 --> 00:14:11.570
What is this?

00:14:11.570 --> 00:14:12.080
This is

00:14:17.270 --> 00:14:20.840
the same thing we were trapped in.

00:14:21.740 --> 00:14:23.050
Who's inside?

00:14:25.140 --> 00:14:28.710
So you escaped the Silky Thread.

00:14:29.530 --> 00:14:30.790
That voice!

00:14:31.340 --> 00:14:32.240
Papillon.

00:14:34.190 --> 00:14:38.480
I didn't think the Silky Thread would work.

00:14:38.580 --> 00:14:39.730
What did you say?

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:44.320
I used the Silky Thread to buy time.

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:51.250
For my final transformation,
I needed to take a little nap.

00:14:51.500 --> 00:14:58.180
Nap? Transformation? So you're
not in your true form?

00:14:58.390 --> 00:14:59.160
What?

00:14:59.280 --> 00:15:04.320
I'll show you my true identity.

00:15:13.880 --> 00:15:14.950
Just as I thought.

00:15:15.420 --> 00:15:18.720
So that's your true identity, Papillon.

00:15:36.360 --> 00:15:38.360
This is his true identity?

00:15:38.470 --> 00:15:45.050
With my final transformation,
one thing is for sure.

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:48.710
That is, Mu, your death.

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:52.980
Stop running your mouth! I'm your opponent!

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:57.750
You weren't even a match
for Gigant, Bronze Saint.

00:15:57.860 --> 00:15:59.550
Foolish.

00:16:10.630 --> 00:16:11.200
Seiya.

00:16:32.620 --> 00:16:37.210
Seiya, Athena, Miss Saori is waiting for you.

00:16:39.050 --> 00:16:40.580
I won't...

00:16:43.430 --> 00:16:44.340
Seiya!

00:16:45.110 --> 00:16:47.440
...be defeated...

00:16:48.220 --> 00:16:49.350
Seiya!

00:16:51.100 --> 00:16:52.820
...in a place like this!

00:16:54.470 --> 00:16:56.580
Not ever!

00:16:58.040 --> 00:16:59.130
Seiya.

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:03.100
My psychokinesis powers

00:17:03.100 --> 00:17:07.200
that restrained even Mu!

00:17:07.780 --> 00:17:09.710
Your opponent

00:17:09.970 --> 00:17:12.180
is me!

00:17:15.420 --> 00:17:17.300
Fine, Seiya.

00:17:21.400 --> 00:17:24.180
Let's see how far your luck takes you.

00:17:24.440 --> 00:17:28.730
Next time you see a Specter will
you be easily defeated, or...

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:32.180
Do you want to bet? Be off.

00:17:32.410 --> 00:17:33.240
What?

00:17:33.410 --> 00:17:35.600
Seiya, you go ahead.

00:17:36.180 --> 00:17:40.410
Even you belittle me. We're
both Athena's Saints.

00:17:40.710 --> 00:17:41.870
And yet.

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:45.270
Yes, we are both Athena's Saints.

00:17:45.700 --> 00:17:51.410
And as Athena's Saints, our
priority is to protect Athena.

00:17:51.820 --> 00:17:56.660
Go, Seiya. I will entrust Athena to you.

00:17:57.790 --> 00:18:02.130
All right, Mu, but you better catch up.

00:18:02.450 --> 00:18:04.900
You still haven't repaired my Cloth.

00:18:06.410 --> 00:18:07.630
I promise.

00:18:08.250 --> 00:18:08.960
Mmm.

00:18:13.090 --> 00:18:13.810
Finally.

00:18:14.040 --> 00:18:18.770
The pest is gone. Now we can fight.

00:18:19.150 --> 00:18:22.870
You said you'd bet on Seiya's luck.

00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:24.250
Hmm?

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:31.910
You don't know the strength of
a Saint and Seiya's true Cosmo.

00:18:32.780 --> 00:18:34.810
True Cosmo?

00:18:34.860 --> 00:18:39.900
As long as he has the strength
and will to get back up again,

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:43.880
a Saint has the power to cause a miracle.

00:18:44.940 --> 00:18:46.330
Really?

00:18:57.280 --> 00:19:01.590
Mu, these are the butterflies
of the Underworld, fairies.

00:19:01.590 --> 00:19:07.620
They will carry you to the Underworld.
You won't have a chance to resist.

00:19:09.130 --> 00:19:10.620
Farewell, Mu.

00:19:11.660 --> 00:19:13.560
Fairies Longing!

00:19:18.780 --> 00:19:19.530
Hmm?

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:25.340
Mu, you are no ordinary Saint.
You avoided it by teleportation.

00:19:25.630 --> 00:19:28.370
You can run but you can't hide.

00:19:28.370 --> 00:19:31.340
The fairies always find the enemy.

00:19:42.100 --> 00:19:42.930
You're right there.

00:19:43.260 --> 00:19:44.690
Fairies Longing!

00:19:49.590 --> 00:19:52.540
Impossible! Again?

00:19:53.130 --> 00:19:57.490
But why? Why don't you teleport further away?

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:02.530
Why does he stay near his grave?

00:20:03.460 --> 00:20:07.060
This is not my final resting place.

00:20:07.060 --> 00:20:07.730
What?

00:20:07.910 --> 00:20:09.250
Don't you get it?

00:20:09.250 --> 00:20:12.590
This Cancer house is your grave!

00:20:13.680 --> 00:20:14.840
What?

00:20:17.200 --> 00:20:18.720
Crystal Net!

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:24.480
When did you make this?

00:20:25.300 --> 00:20:28.950
Papillon, there's no escape.

00:20:33.160 --> 00:20:38.870
If you attack, you'll be
the first to die, Papillon.

00:20:41.250 --> 00:20:47.520
The ghost Specters from Hades's
Underworld do not fear death?

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:51.460
Don't compare me to Shion or Saga.

00:20:51.610 --> 00:20:54.890
We true Specters are no ghosts.

00:20:55.000 --> 00:21:00.340
Like the Saints, we are humans born on earth.

00:21:00.340 --> 00:21:01.320
What?

00:21:02.170 --> 00:21:05.390
By the resurrection of the 108 Evil Stars,

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:11.150
the Specter spirits within
us have been reawakened.

00:21:11.530 --> 00:21:18.090
We are fundamentally different than the
Saints who betrayed Athena for life!

00:21:19.850 --> 00:21:23.460
Fairies, carry Mu to the Underworld!

00:21:23.650 --> 00:21:25.540
Look closely, Papillon.

00:21:25.750 --> 00:21:26.530
Huh?

00:21:30.010 --> 00:21:33.550
What? The fairies are
caught in the Crystal Net!

00:21:35.260 --> 00:21:39.220
Papillon, have them take
you to the Underworld.

00:21:39.710 --> 00:21:42.490
Starlight Extinction!

00:22:00.180 --> 00:22:04.400
Each Specter possesses such strength.

00:22:05.380 --> 00:22:08.020
Strength that is even with Aioria's.

00:22:08.730 --> 00:22:10.410
I must hurry to the Leo house.

00:23:39.720 --> 00:23:41.650
When the glittering golden lion roars,

00:23:42.110 --> 00:23:44.680
God's anger descends on this earth and

00:23:45.090 --> 00:23:47.310
the evil Specters must parish.

00:23:47.770 --> 00:23:52.470
But no one can brush aside the premonition
of sadness the battle may bring.

00:23:52.610 --> 00:23:57.270
Shiri, Hyoga, Shun. We will
provide hope in this battle.

00:23:57.500 --> 00:24:00.020
Saint Seiya, "The Moment of Vacillation."

00:24:00.020 --> 00:24:02.420
Do you sense the Cosmo?
